### Audit log: super_admin ONLY (separation of duties; read only, the table is append-only)
# Run some requests from the other files first, then look here.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@agentKey = pmk_00000000_DEV-ONLY_local-agent-key_CHANGE-ME-outside0

### Login as super_admin (the only role that can read the audit log)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@example.com",
  "password": "SuperAdmin123"
}

### Newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Only denied attempts (403s)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?outcome=denied
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Only one kind of action (e.g. category.create, product.update, user.deactivate)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?action=category.create
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Everything that happened to categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?resourceType=category
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Who am I as the agent (copy "id" to filter by actorId below)
# @name agentMe
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
X-API-Key: {{agentKey}}

### Everything the agent did
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?actorId={{agentMe.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### A time window (ISO 8601)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2030-01-01T00:00:00Z&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### An admin cannot read the audit log: 403 (separation of duties; the denial is audited)
# @name admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin12345"
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### The agent cannot read the audit log: 403 (and that denial is itself audited)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs
X-API-Key: {{agentKey}}
